          "explanation": "Untrusted input from request.getParameterMap() is passed to ThingInterface.doSomething via ThingFactory.createThing(). Because the concrete implementation of ThingInterface (such as Thing1 or Thing2) is dynamically instantiated based on external configuration and not provided in the source context, it cannot be determined whether the input is sanitized or safely handled before concatenation into the SQL query.",
